    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Heist Too is a 3D sandbox open-world game set in the quirky, atomic 1960s-inspired city of Rywadorium, where you step into the shoes of a thief leading a double life as a seemingly ordinary citizen.\u00a0The game blends elements of stealth, adventure, puzzle-solving, and RPG, offering players a rich playground to explore and experiment with various criminal playstyles without quest markers, encouraging creativity and problem-solving in how you approach each heist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-world exploration:</strong>\u00a0Roam diverse city regions, interact with numerous objects and environments, and discover resources that can aid your heists or hinder you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playstyles:</strong>\u00a0Choose to be a stealthy mastermind, sneaky and unseen, or a bold outlaw who uses brute force and guns blazing; your decisions impact gameplay and consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic interactions:</strong>\u00a0Engage with citizens, decide how to talk or manipulate them, and rely on your partner in crime, Bernard Maidenhoff, for tips and support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource management and customization:</strong>\u00a0Visit shops, gas stations, and workshops to buy or acquire equipment like gliders or lockpicks, or procure gear from the black market to enhance your thieving capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique setting and tone:</strong>\u00a0The game\u2019s art style and world draw inspiration from titles like Atomic Heart, Bioshock, and We Happy Few, mixing surreal, dark humor with a retro-futuristic 60s vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consequences and challenges:</strong>\u00a0Getting caught by police or robots has serious repercussions, adding tension and stakes to your criminal endeavors</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, We Heist Too offers a sandbox thief simulator experience with stealth, puzzle, and RPG elements wrapped in a colorful, surreal, and humorous atomic 60s world. It invites players to craft their own criminal stories with freedom and creativity, making each heist a unique challenge and adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Heist Too is a 3D sandbox open-world game set in the quirky, atomic 1960s-inspired city of Rywadorium, where you step into the shoes of a thief leading a double life as a seemingly ordinary citizen.\u00a0The game blends elements of stealth, adventure, puzzle-solving, and RPG, offering players a rich playground to explore and experiment with various criminal playstyles without quest markers, encouraging creativity and problem-solving in how you approach each heist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-world exploration:</strong>\u00a0Roam diverse city regions, interact with numerous objects and environments, and discover resources that can aid your heists or hinder you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playstyles:</strong>\u00a0Choose to be a stealthy mastermind, sneaky and unseen, or a bold outlaw who uses brute force and guns blazing; your decisions impact gameplay and consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic interactions:</strong>\u00a0Engage with citizens, decide how to talk or manipulate them, and rely on your partner in crime, Bernard Maidenhoff, for tips and support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource management and customization:</strong>\u00a0Visit shops, gas stations, and workshops to buy or acquire equipment like gliders or lockpicks, or procure gear from the black market to enhance your thieving capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique setting and tone:</strong>\u00a0The game\u2019s art style and world draw inspiration from titles like Atomic Heart, Bioshock, and We Happy Few, mixing surreal, dark humor with a retro-futuristic 60s vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consequences and challenges:</strong>\u00a0Getting caught by police or robots has serious repercussions, adding tension and stakes to your criminal endeavors</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, We Heist Too offers a sandbox thief simulator experience with stealth, puzzle, and RPG elements wrapped in a colorful, surreal, and humorous atomic 60s world. It invites players to craft their own criminal stories with freedom and creativity, making each heist a unique challenge and adventure.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the city of Rywadorium! Explore the unique regions of the city and pretend you're a regular citizen with no illegal intentions. Enter people's homes without permission and immerse yourself into a role of a thief in a unique setting of atomic 1960s fiction, at this regular day at 'work'.",
